match-parts.ts adapts the part-matching plan of TransformMatchingAbstractBase from Manim Community
(https://github.com/ManimCommunity/manim, manim/animation/transform_matching_parts.py, commit
622520d341), the base of TransformMatchingShapes and TransformMatchingTex. No lines are copied: the
algorithm is re-expressed in TypeScript as a pure function, and its header lists the changes.
